{"id": "3005369", "revid": "119536", "url": "https://ro.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3005369", "title": "Generali Open Kitzb\u00fchel 2023 \u2013 Dublu", "text": "Generali Open Kitzb\u00fchel 2023 \u2013 Dublu a avut loc \u00een prima jum\u0103tate a lunii august 2023. Treizeci \u0219i doi de juc\u0103tori s-au \u00eenscris \u00een competi\u021bia de dublu a turneului de tenis de la Kitzb\u00fchel, Austria, jucat pe terenuri cu zgur\u0103, \u00een exterior. \nPedro Mart\u00ednez \u0219i Lorenzo Sonego au fost campionii en-titre, dar au ales s\u0103 nu-\u0219i apere titlul.\nAlexander Erler \u0219i Lucas Miedler au c\u00e2\u0219tigat titlul de dublu masculin la Generali Open Kitzb\u00fchel 2023, \u00eenving\u00e2nd perechea Gonzalo Escobar \u0219i Aleksandr Nedovyesov \u00een final\u0103, cu scorul de 6\u20134, 6\u20134."}
