{"id": "3005494", "revid": "119536", "url": "https://ro.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3005494", "title": "WTA Praga Open 2023 \u2013 Dublu", "text": "WTA Praga Open 2023 \u2013 Dublu a avut loc \u00een prima jum\u0103tate a lunii august 2023. \u0218aisprezece perechi de juc\u0103toare s-au \u00eenscris \u00een competi\u021bia de dublu a turneului de tenis de la Praga, Republica Ceh\u0103, jucat pe terenuri cu suprafa\u021ba dur\u0103, \u00een aer liber. Anastasia Potapova \u0219i Yana Sizikova au fost campioanele en-titre, dar au ales s\u0103 nu-\u0219i apere titlul.\nNao Hibino \u0219i Oksana Kalashnikova au \u00eenvins perechea Quinn Gleason \u0219i Elixane Lechemia \u00een final\u0103, cu 6\u20137(7\u20139), 7\u20135, [10\u20133], \u0219i au c\u00e2\u0219tigat titlul de dubu la WTA Praga Open 2023."}
